# Files the AI summary must not read when it builds the review of a pull request. One pattern per line; `#` starts a comment.
#
#   docs/     a trailing slash means that whole folder
#   *.svg     anything else is a pattern matched against the path and the file name
#
# Secrets and state (*.tfstate, .env, *.pem, *.tfvars, keys...) are ALWAYS blocked by the code (tools/reviewer/redact_secrets.py);
# this list is for what else the AI does not need to read.
.history/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.svg
